cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use scribe_eval, please cite it as below."
title: "scribe_eval: an evaluation harness for clinical scribes"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Scribnic"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/eljoserass/scribe_eval"
abstract: >-
  Runs a clinical scribe over datasets, scores its transcripts and notes, and
  keeps every run resumable. Any scribe can plug in through one interface.
keywords:
  - clinical scribe
  - evaluation
  - speech recognition
  - clinical notes
